sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CLI as eval/run.py
    participant EL as EvalLoader
    participant ER as EvalRunner
    participant L1 as sgme/engine/l1.py
    participant L15 as sgme/engine/l15.py
    participant L2 as sgme/engine/l2.py
    participant PS as sgme/prompts/manager.py
    participant NORM as sgme/engine/normalize.py
    participant MC as MetricsCalculator
    participant RG as ReportGenerator
    participant MD as sgme/storage/memory_dao.py
    participant DB as eval/tmp/ (eval DB)

    Note over User,DB: 一次完整 baseline run（python -m eval.run --cases v001.yaml --stages all）

    User->>CLI: python -m eval.run --cases eval/cases/v001.yaml --stages all --prompt-version v001
    CLI->>EL: load_yaml("eval/cases/v001.yaml")
    EL->>EL: yaml.safe_load + validate_case() 逐条校验
    EL-->>CLI: list[EvalCase] (80 cases)

    CLI->>ER: EvalRunner(cfg, prompt_version="v001")
    ER->>ER: _setup_eval_db()
    Note over ER: 创建 eval/tmp/eval_memory.db + eval_wiki.db<br/>（独立于生产 DB，init_databases(eval_tmp_dir)）

    loop 每个 eval case
        ER->>ER: run_one(case, stages=["l1","l2"])

        Note over ER,L1: ── L1 提取 ──
        ER->>PS: get("l1_extraction", BucketCtx(overrides={"l1_extraction":"versions/l1_extraction/v001.txt"}))
        PS->>PS: 读 manifest + versions/v001.txt（实时读盘）
        PS-->>ER: PromptVersion(text=提示词全文, version="v001", variant=None)
        ER->>L1: extract_l1(case.conversation, cfg["dimensions"], cfg["llm"], bucket_ctx=...)
        L1->>L1: render_l1(template, conversation, dimensions)
        L1->>L1: llm_chain.call_with_fallback() → parse_l1_output()
        L1-->>ER: (raw_memories, provider, prompt_meta)

        Note over ER,NORM: ── 维度归一化 ──
        ER->>MD: build_alias_map(mem_conn)
        MD-->>ER: alias_map: dict[str, str]
        ER->>NORM: normalize_batch(raw_memories[].dimensions, alias_map, registry_names)
        NORM->>NORM: 别名表命中 → fuzzy 兜底 → 未命中丢弃+告警
        NORM-->>ER: (dimension_ids, stats)

        Note over ER,L15: ── L1.5 冲突提炼（L2 评测需要完整链路） ──
        ER->>MD: insert_memory() × N 条（落库到 eval_memory.db）
        ER->>PS: get("l1_conflict", BucketCtx(overrides={"l1_conflict":"versions/l1_conflict/v001.txt"}))
        PS-->>ER: PromptVersion
        ER->>L15: resolve_conflicts(normalized_memories, eval_mem_conn, cfg, bucket_ctx=...)
        L15->>L15: build_candidate_pool() → batch_candidates() → LLM 裁决 → 四动作落库
        L15-->>ER: L15Result (stored/updated/merged memory_ids)

        Note over ER,L2: ── L2 场景聚合 ──
        ER->>PS: get("l2_scene", BucketCtx(overrides={"l2_scene":"versions/l2_scene/v001.txt"}))
        PS-->>ER: PromptVersion
        ER->>L2: aggregate(memories_with_ids, eval_mem_conn, eval_wiki_conn, cfg, bucket_ctx=...)
        L2->>L2: _ensure_persisted() → _batch_memories() → LLM → update/merge/create
        L2-->>ER: L2Result (created/updated/merged scene_ids)

        Note over ER,DB: ── 模板查询验证 ──
        ER->>DB: 按 case.expected_l2.template_section 指定的 mode 执行模板查询
        DB-->>ER: 各 section 返回的 memory_id 列表
        ER->>ER: 比对每条 GT 记忆落入的 section.title 与预期是否一致

        Note over ER,MC: ── 度量计算 ──
        ER->>MC: compute_l1(raw_memories_normalized, case.expected_l1)
        MC->>MC: _match_memories()：内容相似度 + 贪心最大匹配
        MC->>MC: _compute_dimension_tp_fp_fn()：逐维度 TP/FP/FN
        MC->>MC: 计算 F1 / Strict Match / memory_type Acc / time_velocity Acc / priority MAE
        MC-->>ER: L1Metrics (per-case)

        ER->>MC: compute_l2(template_results, case.expected_l2, l1_f1)
        MC->>MC: Section 命中率 + 误入率 + 漏出率 + 画像质量
        MC-->>ER: L2Metrics (per-case)

        ER-->>ER: 累积 CaseResult（per_case 列表）
    end

    Note over ER,MC: ── 汇总度量 ──
    ER->>MC: 汇总全部 per-case metrics → 微平均 F1 / Strict Match Rate / 画像质量
    MC-->>ER: L1Metrics + L2Metrics (aggregated)

    ER->>ER: _teardown_eval_db() （除非 --keep-db 保留临时 DB）

    Note over ER,RG: ── 报告生成 ──
    ER->>RG: generate(result, output_dir="eval/results/20260806T120000Z/")
    RG->>RG: _generate_json() → report.json（结构化指标）
    RG->>RG: _generate_markdown() → report.md（总览面板 + 维度热力图 + 混淆矩阵 + 误差分析）
    RG->>RG: _generate_csv() → per_case.csv（逐用例明细）

    CLI-->>User: 退出码 0（全部 P0 达标：F1≥0.75, Strict≥0.50, memory_type≥0.85, time_vel≥0.80, Section≥0.70, 画像≥0.50）
    Note over CLI,User: 任一 P0 不达标 → exit(1)，CI 可据此阻断合并
